        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-[12.5px] text-[var(--color-cream)]/55 max-w-3xl">
        Patrol-vehicle GPS streams to this dashboard only - never to the public. The aggregate count of active patrols
        per constituency is the only public-facing number.
