            <span class="italic font-[450]">to verified women.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
          <p class="text-[15px] text-[var(--color-ink)]/70 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
            Platforms like this get attacked the moment they launch - men creating fake accounts to test response time
            or simply drain patrol resources. So before you can press the button, you go through one ID gate.
          </p>
